---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import Button from './Button.astro';
import CloudDivider from './CloudDivider.astro';
---

<section class="pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#080b11] via-[#0a0f1d] to-[#0a0f1d] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none -z-0">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-rose-500/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 pb-10 sm:pb-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="About me"
          title="Hey, I'm LUC4N3X."
          subtitle="Software developer, Linux user, and the person behind Levyra."
        />

        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            I build software for myself and keep at it until it works the way I want. Most of my time goes into Android apps, backend APIs and small self-hosted tools.
          </p>
          <p>
            Getting a feature to run the first time is usually the easy part. What I enjoy is everything after that: chasing the weird edge cases, fixing a bug that only shows up on one obscure phone, and cutting complexity until the code reads plainly.
          </p>
          <p>
            A lot of my ideas end up in Levyra, my open-source music player. When I'm not working on it, I'm usually tinkering with local-first setups, audio pipelines or small Linux utilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-b border-white/[0.08] py-5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#38bdf8] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>Kotlin and Jetpack Compose on Android, Python and Docker on the backend, Linux everywhere</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#818cf8] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>I test on real phones, because the strangest bugs only show up on real hardware</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#f43f5e] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>I would rather ship a small, verified fix than a big rewrite nobody has tested</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <Button href="/about" variant="secondary" size="md">
            <span>More about how I work</span>
            <span class="ml-1">→</span>
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[420px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <div class="absolute -inset-8 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#38bdf8]/20 via-[#818cf8]/20 to-[#f43f5e]/15 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-75 pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="relative z-10 w-full rounded-3xl overflow-hidden p-2 bg-gradient-to-tr from-white/[0.08] via-white/[0.03] to-white/[0.06] border border-white/[0.1] shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-500/10 backdrop-blur-sm group hover:border-indigo-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
            <img 
              src="/assets/brand/luc4n3x-avatar.png" 
              alt="Portrait of LUC4N3X" 
              class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-2xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              loading="lazy"
              width="400"
              height="400"
            />
            <div class="py-3 px-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-[#080b11]/60">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-300">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34d399] animate-pulse"></span>
                <span>Arch Linux · Wayland</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-zinc-500">
                Dev Environment
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08]">
              Dual 4K Setup
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08]">
              Neovim & Android Studio
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08]">
              Local Hardware Testing
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <CloudDivider fill="#080b11" />
</section>
